agents models — Display model tiers (default) or sync data

USAGE
  agents models [command]

COMMANDS
  sync         Refresh model data and recompute tiers

DEFAULTS
  Without a subcommand, displays the model tier list from the model catalog cache.

ENVIRONMENT
  AGENTS_CONFIG: config file; AGENTS_PROFILE: profile; AGENTS_HARNESSES: harnesses; XDG_CONFIG_HOME (Windows APPDATA): config directory. XDG_CACHE_HOME (Windows LOCALAPPDATA): model catalog cache.

Use agents help <command> for command-specific help.
